<title>UK: Ex-dividends to take 3.75 points off FTSE March 10.</title>
<headline>Ex-dividends to take 3.75 points off FTSE March 10.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following FTSE 100 stocks will go ex-dividend on March 10 and analysts estimate the effect will be to take 3.75 points off the index that day.</p>
<p>				     DIVIDEND	INDEX</p>
<p>				    (PENCE)	 EFFECT</p>
<p>COMPANY			  Net   Gross    Gross *</p>
<p>Abbey National	     17.400  21.750   1.784 * </p>
<p>British Aerospace	   9.375  11.719   0.293 * </p>
<p>Commercial Union	   18.850  23.563   0.943 * </p>
<p>Standard Chartered	 10.250  12.813   0.730</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7954</p>
</text>
